@startuml
title Expense submission and approval — proposed shared workflow
start
:Member enters expense;
:Validate required fields, positive amount, group membership, payer, participants, split;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
 :Calculate exact shares;
 :Persist pending expense and approval plan atomically;
 :Queue notices for other current group members;
 while (Required approvals complete?) is (no)
  :Authorized reviewer decides;
  if (Reject?) then (yes)
   :Record rejection;
   :Keep out of balance calculation;
   stop
  else (no)
   :Record approval;
  endif
 endwhile (yes)
 :Activate approved expense;
 :Include payer credit and participant debits in balance calculation;
 stop
else (no)
 :Return validation error;
 stop
endif
note right
Pending and rejected expenses never change balances.
Notification delivery is post-commit and may be asynchronous.
end note
@enduml
